#+end_src
#+END:

A closer with a word after the colon:

#+begin: plan-toc
- [[file:edges.org::26][26]] generated diff
- [[file:edges.org::44][44]] entry: PLANNED A site

#+end: ignored
this line survives
#+end:

* PLANNED A site
-- want/e.go --
// Code generated from BOOK.org by make tangle. DO NOT EDIT.

live body
-- plain.org --
#+title: no dynamic block here

#+begin_src go :tangle p.go
package plain
#+end_src

the last line has no newline
-- want/plain.org --
#+title: no dynamic block here

#+begin_src go :tangle p.go
package plain
#+end_src

the last line has no newline
